  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Center for Global Development Europe 2023-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project agreement on knowledge production with Center for Global Development and the Development Leadership Conference 2023 and 2024. The expected effect of the project is that development cooperation providers are better informed and equipped to bring about the changes needed to create a more collaborative, impactful and innovative development cooperation system, notable the need for greater complementary, coherence and engagement between traditional southern development actors, the need for reframed and reconfigured horizontal partnerships, and the need to enhace development effectiveness and impact.</narrative>
  </description>
